  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "じぶんが　おぼえている　わざの　うち\nどれか　１つを　くりだす。\nじぶんが　ねている　ときだけ　つかえる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "자신이 배운 기술 중\n하나를 무작위로 날린다.\n자신이 잠들어 있을 때만 쓸 수 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "從自己已學會的招式中\n隨機選出１個使出。\n只有在睡眠狀態時可以使用。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur utilise une de ses capacités au hasard\npendant qu’il dort.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Anwender setzt per Zufall eine ihm bekannte Attacke\nein. Klappt nur, wenn der Anwender gerade schläft.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Mientras duerme, usa uno de sus movimientos elegido\nal azar.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa sferra a caso una delle proprie mosse\nmentre sta dormendo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "While it is asleep, the user randomly uses one of the\nmoves it knows.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "自分が　おぼえている　技の　うち\nどれか　１つを　くりだす。\n自分が　寝ているときだけ　使える。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "从自己已学会的招式中\n任意使出１个。\n只能在自己睡觉时使用。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Mientras duerme, usa uno de sus movimientos elegido\nal azar.",
